ll_text":"RT @danjokyoku: 📌「不同意」って…？\n\n2023年の法改正で、「強制性交等罪」は「不同意性交等罪」に改められました。処罰の対象になる「同意しないこと、同意しない意思を示すこと、同意しない意思を貫くことが難しい状態での性的行為」について、わかりやすく解説した記事を…","id_str":"2110227974448615672","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"ja","quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":21,"retweeted":false,"retweeted_status_result":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","card":{"legacy":{"binding_values":[{"key":"photo_image_full_size_large","value":{"image_value":{"height":419,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2108549146156449792/V8itfZn3?format=jpg&name=800x419","width":800},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"thumbnail_image","value":{"image_value":{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2108549146156449792/V8itfZn3?format=jpg&name=280x150","width":267},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"description","value":{"string_value":"性犯罪に、より適切に対処できるよう令和5年（2023年）に、「強制性交等罪」は「不同意性交等罪」に改められました。また、SNSなどで、16歳未満のこどもをわいせつ目的で呼び出したり、性的な姿の撮影・送信を求めたりする行為を罰する新たな罪も設けられました。その内容について分かりやすく解説します。","type":"STRING"}},{"key":"domain","value":{"string_value":"www.gov-online.go.jp","type":"STRING"}},{"key":"thumbnail_image_large","value":{"image_value":{"height":320,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2108549146156449792/V8itfZn3?format=jpg&name=800x320_1","width":569},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"summary_photo_image_small","value":{"image_value":{"height":202,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2108549146156449792/V8itfZn3?format=jpg&name=386x202","width":386},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"thumbnail_image_original","value":{"image_value":{"height":540,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2108549146156449792/V8itfZn3?format=jpg&name=orig","width":960},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"site","value":{"scribe_key":"publisher_id","type":"USER","user_value":{"id_str":"461064204","path":[]}}},{"key":"photo_image_full_size_small","value":{"image_value":{"height":202,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2108549146156449792/V8itfZn3?format=jpg&name=386x202","width":386},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"summary_photo_image_large","value":{"image_value"